title Cassette Bluetooth (T4, synthetic names): the headset went away during a take: the controller's notice, as it comes (the take closed and kept)
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT gone
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "The Bluetooth headset disconnected: the take was closed and kept."
shot rec-gone
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
